<p id="S5.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">(<span id="S5.I1.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">RQ2</span>) How is the quality of the causal summaries generated by our Augur?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">◼</span> 
